{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_redesign_notes_card_frames", "label": "Card Frames Redesign Round", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A complete visual rebuild run through the impeccable skill; picked by Louis from a dealt hand of seven candidates (seed f2d16265), with no functionality removed."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_ink_and_gold", "label": "Ink & Gold (previous design system)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The monochrome graphite-and-gold scheme that Card Frames replaced entirely, not layered over."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_impeccable_skill", "label": "Impeccable Skill (redesign methodology)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The redesign was run through this skill rather than by taste, driving the brief and the verification steps used on every round."}, {"id": "check_imports_py", "label": "check_imports.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verifies all local imports resolve across 175 files on every redesign round."}, {"id": "detect_mjs", "label": "detect.mjs (slop detector)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Caught bounce easing on the coin pop, transition:width on the meter fill, and the 3px rarity side-rail as recognisable generated-interface tells."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_verification_suite", "label": "Redesign Verification Suite (control-label regression, 133 logic tests, WCAG matrix)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 116-item control-label regression proved no feature was lost, 133 logic tests confirmed the economy/SRS/marking/timezone/anti-cheat rules were unchanged, and a WCAG contrast matrix verified all 136 colour x surface pairs clear AA in both themes."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_static_harness_bug", "label": "Static Harness Flattered the Build", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The screenshot harness hand-authored one of each rarity onto dashboard cards while the real page hardcoded every item to common; fixed by making the harness compute rarity with the same two rules as the app. Sample data may stand in for a query; it may never stand in for a derivation."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_navigation_slowness_fix", "label": "Navigation Slowness Fix (NavigationProvider)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "next dev disables prefetch so loading.tsx boundaries never show; the real fix holds the pending destination in a capture-phase listener with a CSS-hidden sibling skeleton, since a component cannot commit a state change while its own subtree is suspended."}, {"id": "docs_redesign_notes_neon_password_leak", "label": "Neon DB Password Leak (unrotated)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/redesign-notes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Neon database password pasted into chat earlier should still be rotated \u2014 a standing, u